{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14386","headline":"明皇帝挽歌 · 郑丹","name":"明皇帝挽歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"律历千年会，车书万里同。\n固期常戴日，岂意厌观风。\n地惨新[疆]理，城摧旧战功。\n山河万古壮，今夕尽归空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑丹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14386.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14386","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}